  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the implementation of the Sustainable Food Systems agenda in Chile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop activities supporting the implementation of the sustainable food systems agenda in Chile. 
(1)	Develop a scoping study on the legislation and associated regulations on food donation in the country.
(2)	Update the National Sustainable Food Systems Pathway.
(3)	Hold a workshop for the presentation of the study and the update of the National Pathway.</narrative>
  </description>
